UEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7067803,"initDialog":706780301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[9500],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Wolf_70678/Q7067803","priority":5,"questId":70678,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":706780301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":3999939354,"text":"Bravo, bravo. Another spellbinding performance.","nextNodeIds":[706780302]},{"nodeId":706780302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":829451394,"text":"Are you interested in learning any new Thespian Tricks? By which I mean dashing and elegant poses! In fact, what would you say to a friendly exchange? I'll teach you some Thespian Tricks in return for Toy Medals from the treasure chests.","nextNodeIds":[706780303]},{"nodeId":706780303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":878023850,"text":"Friendship is a wonderful thing, isn't it? Ah, just the word itself gives me a warm, fuzzy feeling in my heart and stomach...","nextNodeIds":[706780304,706780306]},{"nodeId":706780304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2933281274,"text":"It is a lovely thing indeed.","nextNodeIds":[706780305]},{"nodeId":706780305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1215805730,"text":"Yep yep! Gotta love friendship... But, uh, when you say a warm, fuzzy feeling in your stomach... There is something slightly concerning about that.","nextNodeIds":[706780308]},{"nodeId":706780308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3397605498,"text":"Aaanyway... Are you sure you're okay with just Toy Medals? What can they be worth if they're just toys?","nextNodeIds":[706780309]},{"nodeId":706780309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":1106992706,"text":"As long as you believe, even Toy Medals can be more valuable than gold. That is the magic of imagination. Madame Mage told me that. I can't say I entirely understand what she meant, but...","nextNodeIds":[706780310]},{"nodeId":706780310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":4243136994,"text":"The Thespian Tricks — I actually got those from a wish I made to Madame Mage. So as long as she thinks it's a fair trade, I think it should be fine...?","nextNodeIds":[706780311]},{"nodeId":706780311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1044643282,"text":"Hmm, sounds kinda ominous... Don't a lot of scary stories start out that way? You make a reckless wish to a wicked witch, but you end up regretting it when she forces you to pay an impossible price in return...","nextNodeIds":[706780312]},{"nodeId":706780312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":1002261890,"text":"I believe you're misunderstanding the situation, dear guest. There is absolutely nothing to fear. To start with, mages are quite different from wicked witches. And besides, I already told you what the price is — it's the Toy Medals. There's no catch!","nextNodeIds":[706780313]},{"nodeId":706780313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2864465482,"text":"And you're... sure about that?","nextNodeIds":[706780314]},{"nodeId":706780314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":1295207962,"text":"Yes, completely! In any case... I was the one who made the wish, so if someone has to end up paying an impossible price, just leave it to me!","nextNodeIds":[706780315,706780316]},{"nodeId":706780315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1323151042,"text":"...Why do you sound so proud of that?","nextNodeIds":[706780317]},{"nodeId":706780317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":1716794314,"text":"I enjoy watching your performances, so it's well worth it as far as I'm concerned! Hmm, I wonder how many blank pages are left in this book...","nextNodeIds":[706780318]},{"nodeId":706780318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":2886504010,"text":"Ah, but not to worry. Even if we run out of space, new blank pages will be added very soon!","nextNodeIds":[706780319]},{"nodeId":706780319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":9500,"speakerName":"Wolfy","textMapHash":3851899682,"text":"I do look forward to the day when all empty pages are filled with stories...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706780316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2279250594,"text":"We still feel a little bad...","nextNodeIds":[706780317]},{"nodeId":706780306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1273467626,"text":"All my best friendships are built on a warm, fuzzy feeling in my stomach.","nextNodeIds":[706780307]},{"nodeId":706780307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":70919674,"text":"Oh for the love of... Please don't tell Paimon you're thinking about \"emergency food\" again? We're talking about friendship here, okay? Paimon will never understand why that's where your head goes...","nextNodeIds":[706780308]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL"